# sprites.pdl (rmmc) - hotbar sprites as DATA: 16x16 pixel art, one letter per pixel, drawn into hotbar/<name>-bgr.png by rmmc_sprite_op (48x48, 3x nearest, R and B swapped because the editor swaps them back).
